<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Will's Brand Canvas</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A private working canvas for Will Nelson's brand strategy." />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mrwillnelson.com/wills-brand" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,300;6..72,400;6..72,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0e0c0a;
      --ink: #f2ede3;
      --muted: #c3bbae;
      --faint: #8a8378;
      --line: #26221d;
      --raise: #181512;
      --display: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
      --body: "Newsreader", Georgia, serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100% - 48px, 1180px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: clamp(72px, 10vh, 112px) 0 64px;
    }

    .block {
      background: var(--raise);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .north-star {
      padding: 42px 40px 38px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .label {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.17em;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    p,
    ul {
      margin: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: none;
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(42px, 4.6vw, 56px);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.022em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .position {
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 26px);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-top: 24px;
      gap: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--line);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .cell {
      min-height: 300px;
      padding: 30px;
      background: var(--raise);
    }

    .cell h2,
    .step h2,
    .future h2 {
      color: var(--faint);
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.17em;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .cell-title {
      margin-top: 16px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(25px, 2.4vw, 32px);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.022em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .cell-title.narrow {
      max-width: 14ch;
    }

    .cell-copy {
      max-width: 22ch;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 22px);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.48;
    }

    .cell ul {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .cell li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 22px);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.42;
    }

    .cell li + li {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .cell li::before {
      content: "\2022";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--faint);
    }

    .funnel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 40px 1fr 40px 1fr 40px 1.15fr;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .funnel .step h2 {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.55vw, 21px);
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 1.45;
      text-transform: none;
    }

    .step-copy,
    .future-copy,
    .test-copy {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.55vw, 21px);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .arrow {
      align-self: center;
      justify-self: center;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .bottom {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.48fr 1fr;
      gap: 56px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 34px 36px 32px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--muted);
    }

    .future .label,
    .test .label {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .future-copy,
    .test-copy {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 25px);
      line-height: 1.42;
      max-width: 34em;
    }

    .sr-note {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .page {
        width: calc(100% - 40px);
        padding-top: 48px;
      }

      .north-star {
        padding: 32px 28px 30px;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .cell {
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 28px;
      }

      .cell-copy {
        max-width: none;
      }

      .funnel {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 28px;
      }

      .arrow {
        justify-self: start;
        transform: rotate(90deg);
      }

      .bottom {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 30px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 28px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .page {
        width: calc(100% - 32px);
        padding-top: 32px;
        padding-bottom: 40px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
        white-space: normal;
      }

      .position {
        font-size: 20px;
      }

      .cell-title {
        font-size: 27px;
      }

      .cell-copy,
      .cell li,
      .step-copy {
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .future-copy,
      .test-copy {
        font-size: 21px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="block north-star" aria-labelledby="north-star">
      <p class="label">North Star</p>
      <h1 id="north-star">Stories that make customers buy.</h1>
      <p class="position">Position: Be worth listening to.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid" aria-label="Brand canvas">
      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Who</h2>
        <p class="cell-title">$100M+ high-ACV B2B companies</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">Founders and marketers who need more attention from the right accounts.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Problem</h2>
        <p class="cell-title">They do not know what will land.</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">They create content without enough signal from the people they need to influence.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Belief</h2>
        <p class="cell-title">Listen before you create.</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">The best messages already exist in customer, company, and market conversations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>What We Build</h2>
        <p class="cell-title narrow">Agentic Storytelling Systems</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">Systems that find the story, create the message, distribute it, and learn from buyer response.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Media</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Short form video: comment to access skills repo</li>
          <li>Twitter: bangers for TalkStories</li>
          <li>LinkedIn: carousels and images for top of funnel</li>
          <li>YouTube: interviews and breakdowns on target companies</li>
          <li>Maven: teach our system</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Offers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Maven: learn the system.</li>
          <li>TalkStories: know what to say.</li>
          <li>64stories: develop the strategy and narratives, then build the agentic system to manage and scale them.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="block funnel" aria-label="Brand funnel">
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Helpful content</h2>
      </article>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Collect emails</h2>
      </article>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Build Trust</h2>
      </article>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Upsell</h2>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="block bottom" aria-label="Future and content test">
      <article class="future">
        <p class="label">Desired Future</p>
        <p class="future-copy">Content helps grow sales without consuming marketing and leadership.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="test">
        <p class="label">Content Test</p>
        <p class="test-copy">Does this help people with distribution?<br />Does it trigger an emotion?</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="sr-note">Hidden from site navigation. Marked noindex for search engines.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
